{"case_id": "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", "domain": "health", "question": "2022年至现在，命主的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：乙木日主，生于午月（火旺木焚），年柱丁卯（木火通明），月柱丙午（火势极旺），时柱壬午（水火交战）。日主乙木无强根，仅年支卯木为根，但被月、时两午火泄耗严重，火旺木衰，形成“木火伤官”格局，且火炎土燥，水（壬）被火反克，肾水不足。\n\n2022年起进入壬寅、癸卯大运（假设约30岁后），水木运虽助日主，但原局火势过旺，水来激火，反成“水火相战”，易引发心血管、血液、内分泌问题。流年2022壬寅、2023癸卯、2024甲辰，水木增力，但原局火旺，木被火焚，水被火熬，健康上易出现肝火旺、肠胃燥热、代谢异常（如糖尿病倾向），且木主肝胆、筋骨，火主心脏、血液，水主肾、泌尿。\n\n结合选项：\n- A：皮肤敏感（火旺生燥，但非主要）\n- B：大型手术、生命危险（原局无冲克太甚，且水木运有救，可能性低）\n- C：体弱多病、糖尿病反复（火炎土燥，易消渴，但“体弱多病”程度过重）\n- D：身材肥胖、肝肠胃问题、脚患（木被火焚，肝失疏泄，脾土受火克，易生湿浊，肥胖；木主足，火旺木焚，脚部易有疾患；肠胃因火燥而功能紊乱）\n\n综合判断，D最符合火旺木焚、土燥生湿的病理特征，且“脚患”对应木之根受损。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5603, "response_id": "4769b581-5203-4982-8adc-84336a8deced", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 254, "completion_tokens": 408, "total_tokens": 662, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 126}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disable