{"case_id": "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q8", "domain": "career", "question": "命主在2018年至现在，财政状态和事业运势怎样？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：乙木日主生于午月，火旺木焚，年柱丁卯、时柱壬午，月柱丙午，火势极强，日主乙木虽有年支卯木、时干壬水调候，但整体火炎土燥，财星（火）过旺而身弱。2018年戊戌，土旺财星更重，且流年戌土与命局午半合火局，加剧身弱财多之象，主财来财去、积蓄难存。2019-2023年行庚子、辛丑大运，庚辛金为官杀克身，压力大，但子水、丑土能晦火生木，稍有缓解，事业上或有固定工作，但收入仅够开支，难有积蓄。2024甲辰年，甲木帮身，辰土湿土晦火，略有起色，但整体仍属辛苦求财、依赖稳定收入维持的状态。命局财多身弱，感情上因火旺（食伤）而多思多虑，但财政上确如“积蓄全无，幸有固定工作，收入稳定”之象。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q8", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3865, "response_id": "cea563ae-7d45-442d-90aa-3eed4af1af05", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 276, "completion_tokens": 259, "total_tokens": 535, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 20}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q15", "domain": "unknown", "question": "2022年，命主发生的重要事件？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：癸亥 丙辰 己卯 丁卯，日主己土生于辰月，得月干丙火生扶，但地支两卯木克土，年柱癸亥水势强，整体身偏弱，喜火土，忌水木。\n\n2022年为壬寅年，流年天干壬水为正财，地支寅木为正官。壬水合去月干丙火正印（印星被合绊，代表母亲、健康、文书等受损），且壬水通根年支亥水，水势更旺，财星过旺克印。地支寅木与命局两卯木会木局，木势极旺，克身更重，且寅卯辰三会东方木局，木为七杀，攻身严重。\n\n木旺克土，日主己土受克严重，代表自身健康或根基受损。同时，流年寅木与日支卯木、时支卯木形成“寅卯辰”三会木局，木为病（木主肝胆，但土受克则脾胃、肌肉、血液系统易出问题），且木旺生火，火为印，但印被壬水合克，印星受损严重，印代表母亲、住院、文书等。\n\n综合来看，2022年最可能的事件是健康问题导致住院，且印星（母亲、医院）受损，但选项C明确提到“患病，引发其他病症，住院治疗四个月”，这与印星被合克、七杀攻身、木旺克土（土主脾胃、肌肉，木主神经、肝胆，引发并发症）高度吻合。而A（母亲去世）虽印星受损，但未直接显示死亡信号；B（车祸）需金来制木，但流年无金；D（事业债务）财官过旺但身弱不胜，也可能，但住院的象更突出。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q15", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r2_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5610, "response_id": "c52415b1-3584-48ba-8028-15ec90c822c0", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 239, "completion_tokens": 414, "total_tokens": 653, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 111}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disab